#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__admission_destination_detail_id
msgid ""
"The Admission fee line created on the Admission Destination Term to hold the"
" moved amount. Left empty until the actual transfer is applied on Done -- "
"the Admission-path mirror of Destination Detail."
msgstr ""
"Baris biaya Penerimaan yang dibuat pada Termin Tujuan Penerimaan untuk menampung jumlah yang dipindahkan. Dibiarkan kosong hingga transfer sebenarnya diterapkan saat Selesai -- padanan jalur Penerimaan dari Detail Tujuan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission.field_school_payment_term_transfer__admission_destination_term_id
msgid ""
"The Admission payment term the amount is being moved into. Shown, and "
"required, only when Source Type is Admission."
msgstr ""
"Termin pembayaran Penerimaan tujuan pemindahan jumlah. Ditampilkan, dan wajib diisi, hanya bila Jenis Sumber adalah Penerimaan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission.field_school_payment_term_transfer__admission_source_term_id
msgid ""
"The Admission payment term the amount is being moved out of. Shown, and "
"required, only when Source Type is Admission."
msgstr ""
"Termin pembayaran Penerimaan asal pemindahan jumlah. Ditampilkan, dan wajib diisi, hanya bila Jenis Sumber adalah Penerimaan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission.field_school_payment_term_transfer__admission_id
msgid ""
"The open admission whose billed amount is being moved between payment terms."
" Shown, and required, only when Source Type is Admission -- enforced by "
"``_check_source_type_consistency``, not by this field itself."
msgstr ""
"Penerimaan terbuka yang jumlah tagihannya dipindahkan antar termin pembayaran. Ditampilkan, dan wajib diisi, hanya bila Jenis Sumber adalah Penerimaan -- ditegakkan oleh ``_check_source_type_consistency``, bukan oleh field ini sendiri."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer_admission.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__admission_source_detail_id
msgid ""
"The original Admission fee line the amount is being moved from. Selecting it"
" fills Amount Before automatically. Mutually exclusive with Source Detail."
msgstr ""
"Baris biaya Penerimaan asal tempat jumlah dipindahkan. Memilihnya akan mengisi Jumlah Sebelum secara otomatis. Saling eksklusif dengan Detail Sumber."

